<title>USA: Telident Inc stake cut by Okabena.</title>
<headline>Telident Inc stake cut by Okabena.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Okabena Partnership K, a Minnesota general partnership said Thursday it cut its stake in Telident Inc to 276,333 common shares or 4.5 percent from 7.13 percent held previously.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the partnership said it sold 155,000 common shares between October 23 and December 18 at prices ranging from $1.86 to $2.62 per share.</p>
<p>The company provides hardware and software systems.</p>
</text>
